                    %msup
                      %mi C
                      %mo ⊗
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C^\otimes \to N(\Gamma) \stackrel{s}{\to} C^\otimes
          %p
            The monoid object itself is the image of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ⟨
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ⟩
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \langle 1 \rangle
            under
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
